    { id: "17-16", sec: "16. Q&A on the world-fortune works", tag: "4) Q&A",
      core: "The final round began with war but ends with a nameless epidemic",
      blocks: [
        { t: "list", items: [
          "Q: It matters most to realize that all this history was carried out by Sangje-nim, who came as a human to rebuild the human and spirit worlds facing ruin and open a paradise of harmony. Yet in human history it is still a series of suffering. Why did He perform the works of great war?",
          "A: He answered: “The Former Heaven is the fortune of conflict… so I will prevent the great calamity with a small one and open the paradise of transformation.”",
          "Q: What is the disease catastrophe, and why can no one but Dao members escape it?",
          "A: Because of nature's providence of spring birth and autumn killing (春生秋殺) and the way of the Western Spirit governing life (西神司命) at the cosmic autumn: ‘Even the great virtue of heaven and earth is accomplished by the grace and severity of spring birth and autumn killing.’",
          "In spring all is born without limit — humans, animals, plants; in autumn all is emptied, autumn killing: everything born and raised is killed. He called this the matter of the Western Spirit; when smallpox, once gone, breaks out again, the Western Spirit enters on its energy",
          "(The explanation that the final disease breaks all walls and is a creative birth pang is as on page 15)",
          "Over 100 years ago He said human history would be reset with the outbreak of disease: the final round begins with war and ends with an unknown epidemic",
          "“I set East and West fighting to right the tilted board, but they are too mismatched, so the board will be leveled by disease.” And, “The greatest turmoil is the turmoil of disease; the war of East and West will be leveled by disease.”"
        ] },
        { t: "note", title: "※ Duplicates merged", x: "The disease paragraph appears twice on Reordering p30–31; given once" }
      ],
      src: "Reordering p30–31",
      q: { q: "Why can humanity not escape the disease catastrophe?", a: "Because of the providence of spring birth and autumn killing and the way of the Western Spirit at the autumn gaebyeok" } }
